{"data": {"node": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "5022888091116866", "organization": {"id": "170556537282210", "viewer_permissions": [], "application_groupings": {"nodes": [{"viewer_has_update_access": false, "full_applications": {"nodes": [{"id": "5022888091116866"}]}, "id": "231099418639889"}]}}, "firstRevision": {"nodes": [{"application": {"id": "5022888091116866", "release_date": 1615597797, "is_concept": false, "platform": "ANDROID_6DOF", "scheduled_offers": {"count": 4}, "liveChannel": {"nodes": [{"latest_supported_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "id": "36860638156915112"}, "id": "162453678797607"}]}}, "binary": null, "live_binary": null, "created_date": 1780241375, "id": "35937279062584364", "is_initial_release": false, "name_with_fallback": "v12", "pdp_metadata_with_fallback": {"version": 12, "application": {"is_concept": false, "latest_released_pdp_metadata": {"id": "35937694505876153"}, "release_status": "RELEASED", "id": "5022888091116866"}, "id": "35937694505876153", "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED"}, "release_date": null, "administration_status": "APPROVED", "is_first": false, "release_status": "RELEASED", "release_type": "SCHEDULED", "pdp_metadata": {"application": {"default_locale": "en_US", "id": "5022888091116866", "is_first_party": false, "enables_in_app_ads": false, "is_concept": false, "platform": "ANDROID_6DOF"}, "iarc_cert": {"id": "679985445917744"}, "iarc_email": null, "msrp": null, "translations": {"nodes": [{"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "vr_screenshot_01.png", "id": "1477477554070066", "image_type": "APP_IMG_CUBEMAP_SOURCE", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw6-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491821782_1477477560736732_8331326386517490386_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=-yGZcojMf7oQ7kNvwHh66Yw&_nc_oc=AdrGKF_xRRNzg3hQlLW0hj6y-mO-p3jALcFH7le1MgDP9fxe1LZkuHpH6t8LBxWk5XI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw6-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQCECZSrfpm-nXRrudJ_ooyRCct0QCDL7bfxh58c_GW0QA&oe=6A5A26AE"}]}, "id": "27567679489505128", "locale": "es_ES", "screenshots": [], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "TrailerThumbnail.png", "id": "2002315573702303", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw6-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491820441_2002315577035636_3708890098967800180_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=59Ps8n0UCeUQ7kNvwEWTee8&_nc_oc=AdpQfT35x0Ct3xj9bwhbgLrfwSQBIW-hTt9HpTHQbZZtbrF_yc3WPJEc9sFXKQCBvfo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw6-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQAX-Z53_HcEgyGEUfxNjgiIiMxdwfDcLwO5VYQyfJoBCg&oe=6A5A148C"}, "display_name": "Hyperstacks", "keywords": ["combate", "hyper", "logica", "parkour", "editor"], "long_description": "**Hyperstacks es un mundo de desaf\u00edos artesanales, personajes memorables y niveles creados por la comunidad.**\n\nConoce a sus habitantes y juega niveles centrados en **combate, parkour y puzles l\u00f3gicos**. Acepta misiones y explora una biblioteca de creaciones de la comunidad.\n\n# BUCLE DE JUEGO\n\nAvanza por la campa\u00f1a junto a personajes con personalidad y retos distintos. Entre niveles, vuelve al lobby para hablar con ellos, aceptar misiones y desbloquear nuevas mec\u00e1nicas.\n\nLos niveles de Hyperstacks se apoyan en tres pilares:\n\n* **Combate**  \nLucha con armas de RV contra enemigos cuerpo a cuerpo y a distancia. Reacciona bajo presi\u00f3n y usa peligros, entorno y hasta tus propios pu\u00f1os para sobrevivir.\n{1297257805672916}\n\n- **Parkour**  \nEscala, desl\u00edzate, balanc\u00e9ate, nada, salta e improvisa con ganchos, tirolinas, plataformas, teletransportadores, patinaje, lava y m\u00e1s.\n{1396036509235140}\n\n- **L\u00f3gica**  \nGreenlink, un sistema flexible para conectar interacciones, permite desde puzles simples hasta mecanismos complejos.\n{790024434188803}\n\n**Los jugadores pueden llevar estos sistemas m\u00e1s lejos, pero estos tres pilares definen el dise\u00f1o de Hyperstacks y c\u00f3mo se introducen sus niveles.**\n\n# EL EDITOR DE NIVELES ES CLAVE\n\n**Todos los niveles de campa\u00f1a est\u00e1n hechos con las mismas herramientas disponibles para los jugadores.**\n\nEl editor usa un sistema flexible basado en rejilla para crear niveles con \n{813908077947082}", "short_description": "Un mundo VR lleno de combates, parkour, puzles l\u00f3gicos, personajes memorables y niveles creados por la comunidad. Conoce a sus habitantes mediante misiones y descubre una biblioteca cada vez mayor de creaciones de otros jugadores."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "Meta_Square_Chinese.png", "id": "3100520667004361", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491819845_3100520673671027_2947415179316808989_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=OdvjEBm6dnIQ7kNvwHaPubf&_nc_oc=AdqbUbLD4j2JFU0abi7JvedP2BWsN7hLswWiEuV4a9gvJr4HrLe9kPzwY8F6rZByZ3Y&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQByCiYG498Llw7lC_m5Oo9YlhnBiWKYAjrujEp3PoYsZw&oe=6A5A3CFA"}, {"file_name": "Meta_Portrait_Chinese.png", "id": "1344742150894290", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491823812_1344742157560956_3866022420204310527_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=ViTCX6Rb7mcQ7kNvwEs4alo&_nc_oc=AdqJ82RLtQpBruk202R8uoaZ8Bi9WGrCMqjqK8sASuVEtia05lKGaLgw3fieWXdb_mM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQAJXFUTzyfVUYoFOeH7Xop4TLNgfVSuBb5_fzfUDZ4OxA&oe=6A5A24EF"}, {"file_name": "Meta_Hero_Chinese.png", "id": "974871085008315", "image_type": "APP_IMG_HERO", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491824318_974871088341648_5200156850840335780_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=k-Sh5Yo8odYQ7kNvwFZ_84K&_nc_oc=AdoZRNrC5cijrUy_YO1Mb5aMCJU0vpxcNQSYQ7xWCyyXkHoBsrVtQDcBynbrlx83JhI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQCvAxUfAOJiZ5xX__YOpEJu436voQlx9dfbufgGFs-xxw&oe=6A5A4407"}, {"file_name": "Meta_Landscape_Chinese.png", "id": "967906605777481", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491823790_967906609110814_9153742702586604529_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=uEZ8PAPM-qkQ7kNvwFpRmnd&_nc_oc=AdpKFxvCbPjrCGUrqs_hmFdpOw5CUL1m9313br8qisqa2GJzW6MwqNQVNMb937mwnJU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQA_5sUf9d0HAQCsfsRyfgBQ6rlNf04HDjGqEDcJ8HC33g&oe=6A5A29C4"}, {"file_name": "vr_screenshot_01.png", "id": "931637856342770", "image_type": "APP_IMG_CUBEMAP_SOURCE", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491828583_931637859676103_3319102803980754307_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=J7YcHd7Q5AQQ7kNvwG6Uu0Z&_nc_oc=AdoDGOuLtCD2zJATu3lo57uSfvKsqnigUj97VpGur7RK3lfrKSdTqV7W9nTii19-5dI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQChA7kRjOXsOX4r-Epl4fCAe7G7D7rkvQEvYNvskPL6Vw&oe=6A5A2313"}]}, "id": "2031823481091173", "locale": "zh_CN", "screenshots": [], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Meta_Landscape_Chinese.png", "id": "1888526371861648", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw6-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491820892_1888526378528314_5502493121583461863_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=yymq_unLmEYQ7kNvwHNgyYI&_nc_oc=AdqQ63JPgi59ABFNnTPWJLO8e3ESD08rzl2sjCSiNZfJri0sd43RM4II_wyzi98gOLA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw6-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQCVNc9MfmulDoK7xy439OExnf6-YD5jgmxrzwKrjfB78Q&oe=6A5A3580"}, "display_name": "\u4ea5\u4f2f\u5236\u9020", "keywords": ["\u6218\u6597", "\u8dd1\u9177", "\u89e3\u8c1c", "\u5173\u5361\u7f16\u8f91\u5668"], "long_description": "**\u300a\u4ea5\u4f2f\u5236\u9020\u300b\u662f\u4e00\u4e2a\u6c47\u805a\u7cbe\u5fc3\u8bbe\u8ba1\u7684\u6311\u6218\u3001\u4e2a\u6027\u9c9c\u660e\u7684\u89d2\u8272\u4e0e\u73a9\u5bb6\u81ea\u5236\u5173\u5361\u7684\u4e16\u754c\u3002**\n\n\u7ed3\u8bc6\u8fd9\u91cc\u7684\u5c45\u6c11\uff0c\u4f53\u9a8c\u56f4\u7ed5 **\u6218\u6597\u3001\u8dd1\u9177\u4e0e\u903b\u8f91\u89e3\u8c1c** \u7cbe\u5fc3\u6253\u9020\u7684\u5173\u5361\u3002\u63a5\u53d6\u7531\u5404\u4e2a\u89d2\u8272\u5e26\u6765\u7684\u4efb\u52a1\uff0c\u5e76\u63a2\u7d22\u4e0d\u65ad\u6269\u5c55\u7684\u73a9\u5bb6\u521b\u4f5c\u5185\u5bb9\u5e93\u3002\n\n# \u6838\u5fc3\u73a9\u6cd5\u5faa\u73af\n\u5728\u7531\u4f17\u591a\u89d2\u8272\u4e32\u8054\u8d77\u6765\u7684\u6218\u5f79\u5173\u5361\u4e2d\u4e0d\u65ad\u63a8\u8fdb\uff1b\u6bcf\u4f4d\u89d2\u8272\u90fd\u62e5\u6709\u9c9c\u660e\u7684\u4e2a\u6027\uff0c\u4ee5\u53ca\u5404\u5177\u7279\u8272\u7684\u6311\u6218\u98ce\u683c\u3002\u6bcf\u5b8c\u6210\u4e00\u4e2a\u5173\u5361\u540e\uff0c\u4f60\u90fd\u53ef\u4ee5\u56de\u5230\u5927\u5385\u4e0e\u4ed6\u4eec\u4e92\u52a8\u3001\u63a5\u53d6\u4efb\u52a1\uff0c\u5e76\u89e3\u9501\u65b0\u7684\u673a\u5236\u3002\n\n\u300a\u4ea5\u4f2f\u5236\u9020\u300b\u7684\u5927\u591a\u6570\u5173\u5361\u90fd\u56f4\u7ed5\u4e09\u5927\u6838\u5fc3\u652f\u67f1\u5c55\u5f00\uff1a\n\n- **\u6218\u6597**  \n\u4f7f\u7528 VR \u6b66\u5668\uff0c\u5728\u6fc0\u70c8\u7684\u906d\u9047\u6218\u4e2d\u5bf9\u6297\u8fd1\u6218\u4e0e\u8fdc\u7a0b\u654c\u4eba\u3002\u5728\u9ad8\u538b\u4e4b\u4e0b\u8fc5\u901f\u53cd\u5e94\uff0c\u5229\u7528\u573a\u666f\u4e2d\u7684\u5371\u9669\u3001\u73af\u5883\u8981\u7d20\uff0c\u751a\u81f3\u76f4\u63a5\u6325\u62f3\u6c42\u751f\u3002\n{989248906982984}\n\n- **\u8dd1\u9177**  \n\u6500\u722c\u3001\u6ed1\u7d22\u3001\u6446\u8361\u3001\u6e38\u6cf3\u3001\u8df3\u8dc3\uff0c\u5e76\u5728\u5173\u5361\u4e2d\u7075\u6d3b\u5e94\u53d8\u3002\u501f\u52a9\u6293\u94a9\u3001\u6ed1\u7d22\u3001\u8df3\u53f0\u3001\u4f20\u9001\u5668\u3001\u6ed1\u884c\u3001\u70bd\u70ed\u5ca9\u6d46\u7b49\u591a\u79cd\u5143\u7d20\u4e00\u8def\u524d\u8fdb\u3002\n{913483548120279}\n\n- **\u903b\u8f91**  \n\u7531\u201c\u7eff\u9752\u94fe\u201d\u7cfb\u7edf\u9a71\u52a8\u2014\u2014\u8fd9\u662f\u4e00\u5957\u7075\u6d3b\u7684\u4ea4\u4e92\u8fde\u63a5\u7cfb\u7edf\u3002\u501f\u52a9\u5b83\uff0c\u300a\u4ea5\u4f2f\u5236\u9020\u300b\u65e2\u80fd\u5448\u73b0\u7b80\u5355\u76f4\u89c2\u7684\u8c1c\u9898\uff0c\u4e5f\u80fd\u6784\u5efa\u590d\u6742\u7cbe\u5de7\u7684\u673a\u5173\u88c5\u7f6e\u3002\n{1279891017427930}\n\n**\u73a9\u5bb6\u5f53\u7136\u4e5f\u53ef\u4ee5\u628a\u8fd9\u4e9b\u7cfb\u7edf\u73a9\u51fa\u610f\u60f3\u4e0d\u5230\u7684\u82b1\u6837\uff0c\u4f46\u8fd9\u4e09\u5927\u6838\u5fc3\u4ecd\u7136\u5b9a\u4e49\u4e86\u300a\u4ea5\u4f2f\u5236\u9020\u300b\u7684\u8bbe\u8ba1\u65b9\u5411\uff0c\u4ee5\u53ca\u4f60\u63a5\u89e6\u5404\u7c7b\u5173\u5361\u7684\u65b9\u5f0f\u3002**\n \n# \u5173\u5361\u7f16\u8f91\u5668\u662f\u6838\u5fc3\n**\u6218\u5f79\u4e2d\u7684\u6bcf\u4e00\u4e2a\u5173\u5361\uff0c\u90fd\u662f\u7528\u4e0e\u73a9\u5bb6\u76f8\u540c\u7684\u5de5\u5177\u6253\u9020\u800c\u6210\u3002**\n\n\u6e38\u620f\u5185\u7f6e\u7684\u5173\u5361\u7f16\u8f91\u5668\u91c7\u7528\u7075\u6d3b\u7684\u7f51\u683c\u7cfb\u7edf\uff0c\u8ba9\u73a9\u5bb6\u80fd\u591f\u521b\u5efa\u5305\u542b\u654c\u4eba\u3001\u9677\u9631\u3001\u79fb\u52a8\u673a\u5236\u3001\u8c1c\u9898\u3001\u903b\u8f91\u7cfb\u7edf\uff0c\u4ee5\u53ca\u8272\u5f69\u4e0e\u5149\u7167\u6548\u679c\u7684\u5173\u5361\u3002\n{1316583270378126}", "short_description": "\u4e00\u4e2a\u878d\u5408\u6218\u6597\u3001\u8dd1\u9177\u3001\u903b\u8f91\u89e3\u8c1c\u3001\u9c9c\u660e\u89d2\u8272\u4e0e\u73a9\u5bb6\u81ea\u5236\u5173\u5361\u7684 VR \u4e16\u754c\u3002\n\u901a\u8fc7\u4efb\u52a1\u7ed3\u8bc6\u8fd9\u91cc\u7684\u89d2\u8272\uff0c\u5e76\u63a2\u7d22\u4e0d\u65ad\u6269\u5c55\u7684\u73a9\u5bb6\u521b\u4f5c\u5185\u5bb9\u5e93\u3002"}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "vr_screenshot_01.png", "id": "851106654168259", "image_type": "APP_IMG_CUBEMAP_SOURCE", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491818885_851106660834925_5218698280257001811_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=VEKpAxgVsucQ7kNvwFQCwJP&_nc_oc=AdoEIpPHG9zpAvESEqmuGbprL0Lhi7dkUj9wUqkh8RPYMBYSNKE3LHhRhvvhS9dvbu8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQDdaP3xWoOziGdr8qF1EIWpOz7l8sMA-sYcX0UtJQvqQQ&oe=6A5A1448"}]}, "id": "1460868759122954", "locale": "es_LA", "screenshots": [], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "TrailerThumbnail.png", "id": "918516387672983", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491821719_918516391006316_4173164220621700920_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=NHexICZg0AYQ7kNvwHxan_a&_nc_oc=AdruWjcWupEa-uinCelP0mc1e0LyxLK6yfsib8gviAT88wSQM59vhrAKH27ys8qENlI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQAzmbOJn4e0PMUIN_OagnplG0n_ZMQXBfr3ZF1G_7Qvmg&oe=6A5A487F"}, "display_name": "Hyperstacks", "keywords": ["combate", "hyper", "logica", "parkour", "editor"], "long_description": "**Hyperstacks es un mundo de desaf\u00edos artesanales, personajes memorables y niveles creados por la comunidad.**\n\nConoce a sus habitantes y juega niveles centrados en **combate, parkour y puzles l\u00f3gicos**. Acepta misiones y explora una biblioteca de creaciones de la comunidad.\n\n# BUCLE DE JUEGO\n\nAvanza por la campa\u00f1a junto a personajes con personalidad y retos distintos. Entre niveles, vuelve al lobby para hablar con ellos, aceptar misiones y desbloquear nuevas mec\u00e1nicas.\n\nLos niveles de Hyperstacks se apoyan en tres pilares:\n\n* **Combate**  \nLucha con armas de RV contra enemigos cuerpo a cuerpo y a distancia. Reacciona bajo presi\u00f3n y usa peligros, entorno y hasta tus propios pu\u00f1os para sobrevivir.\n{756856830842786}\n\n- **Parkour**  \nEscala, desl\u00edzate, balanc\u00e9ate, nada, salta e improvisa con ganchos, tirolinas, plataformas, teletransportadores, patinaje, lava y m\u00e1s.\n{1279098891015520}\n\n- **L\u00f3gica**  \nGreenlink, un sistema flexible para conectar interacciones, permite desde puzles simples hasta mecanismos complejos.\n{2078702269368307}\n\n**Los jugadores pueden llevar estos sistemas m\u00e1s lejos, pero estos tres pilares definen el dise\u00f1o de Hyperstacks y c\u00f3mo se introducen sus niveles.**\n\n# EL EDITOR DE NIVELES ES CLAVE\n\n**Todos los niveles de campa\u00f1a est\u00e1n hechos con las mismas herramientas disponibles para los jugadores.**\n\nEl editor usa un sistema flexible basado en rejilla para crear niveles con enemigos, trampas, movimiento, puzles, l\u00f3gica, colores e iluminaci\u00f3n.\n{938360748997522}", "short_description": "Un mundo VR lleno de combates, parkour, puzles l\u00f3gicos, personajes memorables y niveles creados por la comunidad. Conoce a sus habitantes mediante misiones y descubre una biblioteca cada vez mayor de creaciones de otros jugadores."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "icon_Hyperstacks - copia.png", "id": "2447223022119987", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw6-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39001664_2447223025453320_2716587971105526305_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=CCRalwx3erQQ7kNvwFIvlUu&_nc_oc=AdoktOiF-oMXvIuJa3caNP9wv83hCA0sabSbhf34rn9iclkSXxLd7mxBjTm8i5N0DK4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw6-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQCXB8cmLnOcxR6r729GM4BmPBI8Nz4g5S683HV0xj6mIw&oe=6A5A223C"}, {"file_name": "Meta_Square.png", "id": "1149968990543517", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491827611_1149968993876850_1561999419689953727_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=vR_AkQrBU6gQ7kNvwEZClBc&_nc_oc=AdoThti-SDJw-Z39SnVMzHufsrarB80EDyJeBD69ti5w6ap6DOI1n7sA_PuJrzIK8lk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQA66WZX0DKEDPZqWXXir1GhTOAlXfqnmrz5Zfd5muTIMw&oe=6A5A41CD"}, {"file_name": "vr_screenshot_01.png", "id": "963182129516565", "image_type": "APP_IMG_CUBEMAP_SOURCE", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491820428_963182132849898_2217540638244637968_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=id1YUswUIqAQ7kNvwHyHpDU&_nc_oc=Adq5ol1DcGZO3tt6STvLOtRlZ9rx8mvGiwBTR3e3tMSiFWGidHECuAanjAxFXPV0s-8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQDpkh0Pu5gTBEP3AtAx_X8K75lIFz